    'ICAO Doc 9137 Part 1 — §8.1(e) synthetic foams; fluorine and organohalogen free foams complying with performance levels A, B and C may be available under the heading of synthetic foams; less long-term damaging to the environment and stable against polar and non-polar hydrocarbons; pseudo plastic materials containing surface active agents, polymer film formers, co-surfactants, stabilizers and anti-freeze compounds; polymer film formers prevent the destruction of finished foam; usable in concentrations up to 6 per cent, with foam-compatible dry powders and with aspirating and non-aspirating equipment',
